// 1-11: green lens + power doors, merged. Practice.
id l1-11
name 1-11 GREEN ROOM
tagline green means go. doors mean wait.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main consumer green
mechanics plank:5 consumer:1 colour:1 blue:3 green:3
new consumer green
portion 3 green ledges in the green zone
portion 3 consumer opens the gate
hardness 3
map
